# env.optional — fallbacks only; the skill runs without these.
# Apify actor for LinkedIn/TikTok ad-presence checks too hostile for search/Playwright.
# If set -> Apify actor; else -> keyless `site:` web search + the Playwright/google-ad-scraper
# presence checks (default):
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Optional SERP upgrade for the presence and CPA/CPC-benchmark queries. If a DataForSEO (or
# Serper) key is set -> structured SERP API; else -> the agent's keyless web search (default):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
SERPER_API_KEY
# Proxy for geo-correct library/SERP presence checks (Robomotion Proxy):
HTTPS_PROXY
